    "title": "IRONMAN Tracker",
    "description": "IRONMAN Tracker provides official real-time athlete tracking for select global IRONMAN and IRONMAN 70.3 endurance events. We bring the excitement of race day to spectators and fans by delivering real-time results for professional and age-group racing.   \r\n \r\nFeatures:\r\n-Track an athlete\u2019s times, paces, split estimates, and division placement in real time\r\n-Interact with live maps of the course\r\n-Track multiple athletes at the same time\r\n-Receive push notifications as progress is made\r\n-Follow important event information and updates\r\n-Share updates to various social media platforms",
